# Flex launcher UI

Read **`AGENTS.md`** before changing this app. Contract source of truth is **`src/Project Contracts/`** (`easyflex` / `complexflex` / `flexforex`), not `UI-LAUNCH.md`. Skill: **`flex-project-contracts`** (`.cursor/skills/flex-project-contracts/` - also `flexforex-extras.md`, `economics.md`). Token manage UI lives at `/token/:contract/:symbol` (holder + issuer, program-gated). Never put `setconfig` or `receiverand` in the UI.

## Stale names (never emit)

`forge` → `create`. `issue` only on **easyflex**. `reglaunch` → `startlaunch`. `stamp` → `liftoff`. `interestoken` / `setflextoken` / `sprouttoken` → `choosereward`. `distribute` / `reflect` → `makeitrain` (`sender` on easyflex/complexflex, `keeper` on flexforex). Launch fields are `xtoken_proof_pool_id`, `pure_liquid_alcor_pool_id`, `dev_bps`, `club_bps`, `swap_underlying_default` - not `proof_pool_id` / `pool_id` / `nyra_bps`.

## Identity and tables

Always pass **symbol + contract**. `stat` / `settings` / `flexers` / `flexpools` scope = **symbol code**. `launches` scope = **contract**. Native flex = `flex_reward_pool_id == 0`. `addpool` then `choosereward(output_symbol, output_contract)`. Empty output contract unflexes.

## Wizard order

`create` → `setfees` → `mint`/`issue` 100% to issuer → `startlaunch` → Alcor `createpool` / `activepool#id` / `transfer` memo `deposit` / one-sided `addliquid` / `lockpos` ≥90d → `liftoff`. Issuer signs Alcor, not the flex contract. Until `launches.launched`, only `to=swap.alcor`. Do not gift `eosio::buyram` to the token contract. After a successful create, freeze Token / Flexonomics / Quote / Range so execute preflight cannot drift.

## Do not

- Call `receiverand` or `setconfig` from the issuer wizard (`setconfig` is contract-only). Overall tax is issuer `setfees` after create. for3x issuers use `ratios` / `setdist` for a share of `reflection_rate` only.
- Treat `stat.angel_numbers_pool` / `jackpot_pool` as unused ABI pads.
- Build inheritance or luck UI on easyflex.
- Edit the three token `.cpp`/`.hpp` unless the user asks.
- Wire `token.proton::reg` to the issuer wizard. Auth is `tcontract@active` (3asy / fl3x / for3x), not the issuer.
